WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.650
Akira?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.440
What are you doing right now?

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.460
Well…

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.150
What about you?

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.270
Nothing very important.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:15.200
I just wanted to hear your voice.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.370
Hey, Princess.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.520
I can really…

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.290
…trust you, right?

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.280
Yes.

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:29.000
Trust me.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.800
I’ll leave first.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.370
Okay.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.100
When I was a child,

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.750
I thought that falling in love led to happiness.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:49.520
I believed that it only led to happiness.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.020
This was when

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:56.200
the innocence of childhood began to fade away.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.390
At the time, Akira-kun and I

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:01.830
were lost in the confusion of the twilight.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.790
We believed in the morning that was to come.

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:08.790
What?

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.050
In the Prime Minister’s residence?

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.460
Are you certain?

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:12.590
Your Highness.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.050
We’re departing.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:21.890
Coward.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.230
Meiren.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:27.980
I’m here.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.110
How did you…

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.180
Hey, why didn’t you just eat her up?

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.280
Because you felt sorry for the Princess?

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:43.870
You could’ve slept with her and forgotten <i>all</i> about this.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:45.420
Don’t try to console me!

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:46.780
Yuki isn’t…

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:47.910
Yuki isn’t like that!

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.990
You’re so kind, Akira-kun.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:56.170
But then, isn’t that also <i>really</i> cruel?

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.590
Just who the hell are you?

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:04.600
My duty is to protect the lineage of the vampires.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.730
I’ve never heard of anyone like you.

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:13.010
Well, what do you really know, Akira?

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.190
That’s right.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:20.860
Your very first date with the Princess was, in fact, just a part of her plan.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.410
She was trying to lure out the ones who were after her life.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:31.210
Just to protect the two of you, an entire company was mobilized.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.020
You looked so gallant,

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:38.800
with the belief that only you could protect the Princess, fending off the enemy desperately!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:47.960
You know nothing about the Vampire Bund or the Princess.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:57.230
She isn’t as kind as you believe she is.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.280
What do you mean?

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:02.280
If you don’t understand, then why don’t you ask her?

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.660
Ask that kind Princess of yours.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:15.990
Wait.

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:17.040
Hey, wait!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.060
My grandson…

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.940
My grandson was attacked by vampires!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.270
Oh my…

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:24.680
That sounds rather unfortunate.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.080
How dare you feign ignorance!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.970
You put them up to the task!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.280
Without doubt,

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:34.810
this incident occurred due to the lack of control I had over my people.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.900
How could I possibly build a nation like this?

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:43.320
I will withdraw the Special District Establishment Bill.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.070
Farewell.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.360
Wait!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.200
Where are you going?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.220
To pick up your grandson.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.430
Goodness, must I spell everything out for you?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.970
If the construction of the Bund cannot be approved,

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:57.660
then we must depart this country,

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.920
in accordance to your so-called “popular vote.”

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:04.610
Your grandson was bitten by a vampire.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:07.470
He is most certainly one of us now.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.470
Your glory for generations to come…

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.980
A pity that it ends now.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.230
Shinya!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.770
Please forgive my rudeness, but I have to refuse.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:36.080
Her Majesty is very fatigued.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.750
I cannot let anyone pass—not even you, Akira-san.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.770
Please, wait!

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:43.630
I really need to talk to her!

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.880
Another time, perhaps.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:54.770
She isn’t as kind as you believe she is.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:02.900
How’s the boy in the VIP room?

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.280
He’s been crying the whole time.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.200
I see…

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:07.700
The boy?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.110
Why would Her Highness do this to such a little boy?

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.350
I’m sure she has a good reason.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:15.530
Right.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:17.790
It’s something we needn’t know.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.120
Why don’t you ask her?

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.760
Ask that kind Princess of yours.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.130
What’s wrong?

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.850
A lady brought me here.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.490
Can you tell me your name?

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.200
Mizoguchi Shinya.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:56.450
Mizoguchi?

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.700
My father is Mizoguchi Kouichi.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.210
My grandpa is Mizoguchi Kazuichi.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.210
The Prime Minister?!

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.120
It hurts.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.970
Can you let me see?

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.540
I want to go home.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.830
Ever since the boy made the oath with the demon queen,

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:23.560
he never strayed from her side.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.520
People spread rumors.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.520
“He has been possessed!”

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.580
“It’s his turn to be eaten now.”

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:35.440
The boy didn’t believe it.

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.290
He did not want to believe it.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.540
He was curious of what was at the top of the tower.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:46.750
The queen locked herself there from time to time, allowing no one to enter.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:59.010
The boy mustered his courage and opened the door to the queen’s room.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.940
There, he saw…

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.290
I have just made the arrangement.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:11.590
Your grandson will awaken in his own bed the coming morning.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.590
Oh, thank you so much.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:18.330
But I require you to disclose something to me before that can occur.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.290
Huh?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.040
It is nothing difficult.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:25.710
Who gave you money and instructed you to reject the bill?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.710
Tell me the name of the one pulling the strings.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:35.550
Yuki!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:40.070
Hey, did you really get attacked by vampires?

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:40.970
Why?

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.270
So you did.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.960
Does that mean there are vampires all over campus?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.320
Who told you that?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.720
Who?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.360
Hiko!

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.240
Stop spouting such random nonsense!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.530
It isn’t a random nonsense.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.990
This academy has long been taken over by them.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.280
Who knows…

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:03.340
Maybe that’s a vampire standing next to you.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.650
Don’t get too cocky with me!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.630
Need us to teach you a lesson again?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.010
What are you smiling at?

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:15.510
Don’t touch me…

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.930
…with your filthy hand!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.250
Stop that, Hikosaka!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.350
He’s right. Aren’t we friends?

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.360
Don’t group me with you.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:39.200
I’m no longer like any of you!

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:43.420
This is so much fun.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:47.070
I understand how you all felt now.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:50.500
Bullying the weak really is fun.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:54.430
I’ve become an existence that surpasses humans!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.510
I’m one of the chosen race of the night.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:58.740
Hiko!

00:08:58.740 --> 00:08:59.470
Why?

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.300
Saegusa-san.

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:03.060
Aren’t you brave?

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:06.310
My friends warned you…

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.810
Yet you still show yourself in front of me!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:12.440
Saegusa!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.400
Hiko.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.000
You…

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.650
Let go of me, Kaburagi-kun.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.940
I don’t want to hurt you.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.380
You were always kind to me.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:43.050
Do you really understand what it means to be a vampire?!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.810
It means to surpass mankind!

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:00.770
My fang! My fang!

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:03.280
Why, Hiko?

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.890
Why a vampire?!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:07.530
Akira-kun…

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:15.450
I get that you wanted power because you were bullied all the time.

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.400
But…

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:18.170
But this is wrong!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.820
Tell me, Hiko.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:25.060
Who turned you into a vampire?

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.760
Who’s your master?

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.520
That’s…

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:32.480
I’m sorry!

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.480
Hiko!

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:50.920
You sound delighted.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.700
Akira.

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:53.230
Rejoice.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.970
The negotiations are finally complete.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.710
There should be an announcement sometime—

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.290
Good for you.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:01.580
What is it, Akira?

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:02.960
You sound upset.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.480
Vampires!

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.770
There are vampires in the school!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:11.020
And they even laid their hands on the students.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.830
So you knew.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.390
I knew it.

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.590
And you knew about the Student Council President too!

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.650
I did receive the report.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.350
It was my mistake to let them take the lead,

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:24.820
but I have my priorities.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:27.680
Priorities?

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.490
Like threatening Japan by kidnapping a boy?!

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:32.490
How do you know?

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:34.460
Because I met him.

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:38.910
It was the decisive moment for the establishment of the Bund.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.920
I had no other choice.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:42.710
But he was a kid!

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.670
No matter the reason, that’s crossing the line!

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.780
Don’t talk as if you know anything!

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.260
What could you know?

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.770
I shoulder the fate of a kingdom.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:58.230
For its future, I cannot hesitate to take any drastic measures!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:00.270
That is what it means to be a statesman!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:05.030
How dare you speak like that when you’re a mere child with no experience in running a nation?!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.780
Princess, please tell me one thing.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.130
That day…

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.690
The day you came to school to see me,

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:19.920
were you here for a different reason?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.970
You won’t believe me, regardless of what I say.

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:25.030
A kid, huh?

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.760
I guess I really am…

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:30.300
For believing such a stupid promise.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:31.970
I must’ve amused you!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:35.480
If you believe that, so be it.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.150
I…

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.910
I <i>want to believe you!</i>

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:05.720
Prime Minister Mizoguchi, who was at the forefront of rejecting the bill, retired early due to ill health.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:12.470
With the retirement of the Prime Minister, who was even prepared to call for a dissolution of parliament,

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:20.730
each side of the government called together the board of directors, as the approval of the bill was inevitable.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:26.480
Furthermore, stock prices have begun to rise rapidly due to foreign institutional investors…

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.820
This person…

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.280
A-And…

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.610
This one too.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:34.320
These are the ones who went berserk like Hikosaka.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.590
This is truly regretful.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:41.080
In the short amount of time since Princess Mina appeared, the Academy—

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.000
No.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.080
The world seems to have completely changed.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.010
Damn it.

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.260
Those vampires…

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:54.930
Akira-kun?

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:55.930
What are you doing here?

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.850
Please lend me your strength.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:02.480
For what purpose?

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:06.230
To drive out all the vampires in this school!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:15.530
President Shinonome, who’s now missing, wished to have the students protected by the students.

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:18.700
We must shoulder her will.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.830
Thank you for your cooperation, Sister Laura.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:28.380
It is my duty as a teacher and a messenger of God to protect the students.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.490
Well then, regarding the plan…

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:38.390
The first step would be to identify the vampires who have hidden themselves on campus as students.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.590
But how?

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:43.980
There are many students who have become vampires already.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.900
There is a way to tell them apart.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:51.860
We’ll hold an all-student assembly in the sun tomorrow morning.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:57.750
As you all know, vampires disintegrate when they are basked in sunlight.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.910
They can't come to the assembly.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:02.080
But couldn’t they just put something on?

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.870
Don’t worry about that either.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:04.620
Akira.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:10.210
Lightblocking gel vaporizes in fifteen minutes under direct sunlight, losing its effect.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.170
It isn’t all almighty.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:14.350
Isn’t that…

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.010
Princess Mina’s—

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:15.670
Can we trust him?
Princess Mina’s—

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:19.050
Kaburagi-kun openly requested our cooperation.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:20.050
Don’t worry.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.260
He’s on our side.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:24.610
They give off a unique smell of blood.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.980
I can tell.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.230
That’s how it is.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:31.560
And just to be sure, are there any vampires here?

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:32.590
No.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.530
Don’t worry.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:37.190
So I’d like you all to sleep here tonight.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:38.280
Why?

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:42.200
Knowing them, they already know what we’re up to.

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:45.190
If we don’t stay together, they’ll get us one by one.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:49.120
Sister, will we be safe here?

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:54.590
The windows here have louver doors, and we have our own power generator, so I believe so.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:59.280
Those who don’t show up tomorrow are vampires.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:01.930
If we can identify them, we can form a plan to deal with them.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.030
We will protect the school with our own hands.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:05.820
Got it?

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:06.430
Yes!

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:17.660
I’d like you to do something for us, Kaburagi-kun.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.660
What is that?

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:21.390
I’d like tools to fight against vampires.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:26.200
We’ll be in danger tonight, and at tomorrow’s assembly as well.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.870
I don’t know what we’ll do if we’re forced into a corner.

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:31.010
Do you think you can get something?

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.210
Maybe if I go to the special district…

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.060
Akira.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:36.570
I also want to ask that of you.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.000
But…
I also want to ask that of you.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.030
I decided to trust you.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.760
Please trust us as well.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:44.340
All right.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:48.810
Akira-kun.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:50.310
Yuki?

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:53.940
Are you sure about this?

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.380
I want to confirm something:

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:57.720
My feelings.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:01.530
For that, I will fight the Princess.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.780
Can I ask you just one thing?

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.210
About that ring…

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.220
Sorry.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.110
Actually, I seem to have lost it.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.170
Did you give it away?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.750
I’d never do that!

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:20.130
After all, that’s the proof of our promise.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.880
I finally remembered it.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.390
Are you the one who gave this to me, Saegusa?

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:31.350
So does that mean that we’re…

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:32.450
No.

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.230
That’s just proof of our promise.

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:38.270
That you and I will be friends forever.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.850
I should’ve just lied…

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:45.690
I should have told you we were lovers.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:51.480
But you didn’t lie to me, and you’ve always stayed by my side.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:56.580
You don’t know how much you saved me when I had lost my memory.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.580
No, it’s okay.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:02.260
I’m also… really… happy.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.260
Thanks, Yuki.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.270
I’ll definitely protect you.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:16.560
Once I go out, lock all the doors and windows, and absolutely do <i>not open them.</i>

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:17.440
Got it?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.190
No matter what!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:20.900
Vampires are sly.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:22.980
They’ll take advantage of the gaps in your heart.

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:25.860
You’ll die if you drop your guard!

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:29.700
Idiot…

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.160
How is it?

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:37.520
We’re pretty much done with the middle school.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.670
We’ll check the high school now—

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:45.670
Is it really going to clear up tomorrow?

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.980
The weather forecast said it would.

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.680
I must say…

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:56.480
This is kind of a roundabout way, in a sense.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:02.870
From what I’ve heard, the vampire race is a pyramid structure with the Queen at the top.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:07.930
If so, everything might work out if we do something about the Queen.

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:11.120
It’s probably impossible, though.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.060
What?!

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:17.160
A blackout?

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:21.180
P-Please stay calm, everyone.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.130
I’ll switch to our own power generator.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:25.960
Could they really have come?

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.300
Everyone.

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:32.850
Everyone.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:34.440
Who is it?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.690
It’s me.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:37.570
Save me.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:38.560
It’s me.

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:40.050
President?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.100
That’s the President’s voice!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.290
No way…

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.450
Are you the President?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.440
I ran away from them, but…

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.930
I got hurt…

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.340
Please, let me in.

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.110
Vice President.

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:53.960
We don’t have a choice.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.200
Just a minute!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.200
We’ll open it right away!

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:58.830
Stop, everyone!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.740
Don’t you remember what Akira-kun said?

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.020
What are you saying?

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.030
It’s the President.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.010
Yeah.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:04.960
She was okay.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:06.070
No…

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:06.720
Wait!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.470
NO!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:16.970
President…

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.560
Yuki-chan.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:21.060
I’m sorry.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.620
Dance with the Three Idiot Maids!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.070
Wait, who are you calling an idiot?

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:35.310
He just won’t stop crying.

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:37.340
Hi, Shinya-kun!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.250
I’m Dracula!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.440
Aren’t I funny?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.460
What the hell are you doing?

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.890
Japanese kids love demons.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:44.730
Are you an idiot?

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:45.710
What kids love…

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:46.790
…is this!

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:49.730
I think you missed the mark.

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:50.360
How so?

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:51.590
I’ve got white horns!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.590
Nella, anything but that!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:55.080
But kids love these.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.090
No, no, no, no, no!

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:57.800
Then the adults will get mad.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.100
How complicated…
